name=Advanced Charging Controller (ACC)
version=v2025.5.18-6.5.1-rc22
versionCode=202505325
author=seyedehsanhadi (fork of ACC by VR-25)
description=Extend battery lifespan by limiting charging current, temperature, and voltage. Includes AMPS (Find my switch): a universal charge-control finder that detects and verifies the switch that works on your phone, writes only reversible switches, and restores on exit. Systemless; works on any root (Magisk / KernelSU / APatch). Forked from VR-25 original ACC and substantially reworked since: charge-direction arbitration, native firmware-limit handling, thermal enforcement, cap lifecycle and switch discovery are all rewritten. Maintained by seyedehsanhadi. Telegram: https://t.me/+hU1oF-BCf5hmM2Rk
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/seyedehsanhadi/acc/dev/module.json
